# Telegram integration (optional — the "Send" button on the signal card only
# appears when the bot token is set).
#
# The app uses ONE bot (yours, e.g. @SignalPHC_bot). Each visitor enters their
# OWN channel address in the UI and must add your bot as an ADMIN of that
# channel with the "Post messages" permission — then the Send button posts the
# signal straight to their channel.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored) and paste the bot token from
# @BotFather, then restart the dev server / rebuild.
#
# WARNING: Vite bakes this value into the built JS bundle, so on a public
# deployment the token is extractable — use a dedicated bot for this app only.
VITE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# Optional: URL of the deployed Cloudflare Worker (see telegram-worker/README.md).
# Enables the "Auto-close after 1 candle" checkbox — the Worker posts CLOSE $COIN
# to the user's channel after one candle even if they closed their browser.
VITE_TELEGRAM_WORKER_URL=
